.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_IRQ 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_get_irq
.Nd return the legacy interrupt line for a PCI function
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_get_irq "pci_device_t *dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_get_irq
function reads the PCI interrupt pin and interrupt line registers and
returns the routable legacy IRQ when present.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
A non-negative IRQ number is returned on success.
The value
.Dv PCI_IRQ_NONE
is returned if the device has no usable legacy interrupt assignment.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_config 9
